      "correct": "4",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[81 ÷ 9 x 3 − 18] + [5 x 8 – 8 ÷ 2 + 9]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nBODMAS consists of the first letter of the operations involved in a mathematical equation.\n\nB- Bracket (), [], {}\n\nO- Order, Square root, exponents, and powers\n\nD- Division, ÷ /\n\nM- Multiplication × *\n\nA – Addition +\n\nS – Subtraction –\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[**81 ÷ 9** x 3 − 18] + [5 x 8 – **8 ÷ 2** + 9]\n\n= [**9 x 3** − 18] + [**5 x 8** – 4 + 9]\n\n= [**27 ****− 18**] + [**40 – 4**** + 9**]\n\n= [9] + [45]\n\n= 54.\n\n**Answer is 54.**",
      "tags": [
        "Simplification"
      ]
